---

This repo bundles a rebuilt copy of STS2MCP (mods/STS2_MCP.dll), a separate
MIT-licensed project by Yikun Ji (Kunologist) — see mods/STS2_MCP_LICENSE.txt.
The bundled DLL is built from https://github.com/DarkArcZ/STS2MCP (branch
fix/v0.111-compat) on top of https://github.com/Gennadiyev/STS2MCP, with two
extra one-line patches to compile against a newer game build (see
mods/PATCH_NOTES.md). Not officially affiliated with either project.
